<title>ESTONIA: FOREIGN DEBT $205.78 MILLION.</title>
<headline>FOREIGN DEBT $205.78 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's foreign debt was at $205.78 million as of July 1, compared to $266 million a month ago, the finance ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The spokesperson for the ministry said the figure includes loans taken by the government.</p>
<p>The government has given guarantees for foreign loans worth $56.9 million, the ministry added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
